Couch is distributed privately by avoid-quest. This package does not grant a
new license to Couch's application source. Third-party components retain their
own licenses in this directory. The bundled coordinator embeds Bun 1.4.2;
its upstream license and component notices are in bun-LICENSE.md. Bun's source
and build instructions are at https://github.com/oven-sh/bun/tree/bun-v1.4.2 .

native.txt records the Rust dependencies included in this Apple Silicon build.
javascript.json and javascript/ record the production JavaScript dependencies.
This Full package includes libmpv, ffprobe, yt-dlp and Deno. macos-native/
contains source and bottle provenance and license notices for the linked
Homebrew libraries. mac-native.json records their original and bundled binary
hashes. The same app can switch to Client-only mode.
